PN,30201
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785772101
OL,3,CReform UK would use Navy to stop small
OL,4,Cboats in the Channel
OL,6,FReform UK has pledged to launch "the
OL,7,Flargest military operation in the
OL,8,FEnglish Channel since World War Two"
OL,9,Fto stop small boat arrivals from
OL,10,FFrance.
OL,12,FIf the party were to lead the
OL,13,Fgovernment, they plan to send the
OL,14,FRoyal Navy into the Channel to
OL,15,Fintercept all migrant boats and return
OL,16,Fthem to France or Belgium.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785772101
OL,3,CReform UK would use Navy to stop small
OL,4,Cboats in the Channel
OL,6,FThe party insists that the plan,
OL,7,Fcalled "Operation Fortress", is in
OL,8,Fline with international law and that
OL,9,Fit will both halt small boat arrivals
OL,10,Fand act as a humanitarian response.
OL,12,FZia Yusuf, the party's home affairs
OL,13,Fspokesman, said: "Britain is being
OL,14,Finvaded. Tory and Labour governments
OL,15,Fresponded with a free ferry service
OL,16,Fand free hotels.
OL,18,F"Reform UK will respond by launching
OL,19,Fthe largest military operation in the
OL,20,FEnglish Channel since World War Two.
OL,26,@uD@ROUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785772101
OL,3,CReform UK would use Navy to stop small
OL,4,Cboats in the Channel
OL,6,F"Nigel Farage will order his Majesty's
OL,7,FRoyal Navy to ensure that not a single
OL,8,Funauthorised vessel crossing the
OL,9,FEnglish Channel makes it to the shores
OL,10,Fof the United Kingdom.
OL,12,F"Those who attempt it will be
OL,13,Fintercepted by our Armed Forces and
OL,14,Freturned to France."
OL,16,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,17,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,18,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,19,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUvD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785772101
OL,3,CReform UK would use Navy to stop small
OL,4,Cboats in the Channel
OL,6,FThe party said the situation in the
OL,7,FNorth African Spanish enclave of
OL,8,FCeuta, where some 60,000 migrants
OL,9,Fbreached the border to enter Spanish
OL,10,Fterritory last week, shows the
OL,11,F"urgency" for its proposed plan.
OL,13,FMost of the migrants in Ceuta had
OL,14,Fwalked back to neighbouring Morocco by
OL,15,FSunday.
OL,17,FReform UK is proposing to set up a
OL,18,Fjoint military command with units from
OL,19,Fthe Royal Navy, Royal Marines, RAF and
OL,20,FBritish Army as well as a surveillance
OL,21,Fcommand to track incoming boats.
OL,26,@sD@AOUsD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785772101
OL,3,CReform UK would use Navy to stop small
OL,4,Cboats in the Channel
OL,6,FThe armed forces would intercept
OL,7,Funauthorised boats and detain their
OL,8,Foccupants, giving them water and food
OL,9,Fand a medical assessment before
OL,10,Freturning them under escort on navy
OL,11,Fvessels, the party said.
OL,13,FInternational conventions on the sea
OL,14,Fallow for states to pick people up
OL,15,Ffrom boats if they are in danger of
OL,16,Fbeing lost but do not allow for them
OL,17,Fto be taken to another country without
OL,18,Fthat nation's consent.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785772101
OL,3,CReform UK would use Navy to stop small
OL,4,Cboats in the Channel
OL,6,FFormer Royal Navy commander Tom Sharpe
OL,7,Fcast doubt over whether Reform's
OL,8,Fproposal was workable.
OL,10,F"When you start looking at what ships
OL,11,Fwe have, which is basically none ` I
OL,12,Fmean, he's talking about the largest
OL,13,Fmaritime operation in the Channel
OL,14,Fsince World War Two, a very evocative
OL,15,Fimage, but that's not the reality," he
OL,16,Fsaid, also speaking on the Today
OL,17,Fprogramme.
OL,19,F"We don't have the ships."
OL,26,@rD@AOUwD@cO]{D@AOU{D@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
