OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785772101
OL,3,CReform UK would use Navy to stop small
OL,4,Cboats in the Channel
OL,6,FLabour criticised the "reheated"
OL,7,Fannouncement and said, "anger and easy
OL,8,Fanswers won't bring crossings down".
OL,10,FCurrently, the UK government has a
OL,11,F#660 million deal with France that
OL,12,Fstipulates they must provide more
OL,13,Fpolice and military personnel to
OL,14,Fpatrol the beaches where boats are
OL,15,Flaunched from.
OL,17,FThe UK-France treaty also allows the
OL,18,FUK to detain and rapidly remove people
OL,19,Fwho enter illegally via small boats,
OL,20,Fblocking their access to the asylum
OL,21,Fsystem.
OL,26,@nD@WOUnD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
