OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785772101
OL,3,CReform UK would use Navy to stop small
OL,4,Cboats in the Channel
OL,6,FNeither France nor Belgium have
OL,7,Fcommented on Reform's proposals.
OL,9,FA Labour Party spokesperson said:
OL,10,F"Reform have reheated an old
OL,11,Fannouncement in their latest desperate
OL,12,Fbid to distract from their growing
OL,13,Fsleaze scandals.
OL,15,F"Anger and easy answers won't bring
OL,16,Fcrossings down. The serious action
OL,17,Fwe've taken has started to have a real
OL,18,Fimpact and has led to 46,000 attempted
OL,19,Fcrossings stopped, and 70,000 people
OL,20,Fwith no right to be here removed.
OL,26,@rD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785772101
OL,3,CReform UK would use Navy to stop small
OL,4,Cboats in the Channel
OL,6,F"We know there's more to do on this
OL,7,Fcomplex issue."
OL,9,FLast Wednesday marked the busiest day
OL,10,Ffor small boat crossings across the
OL,11,FEnglish Channel so far this year, with
OL,12,F752 migrants arriving in the UK.
OL,14,FThe number of people who have crossed
OL,15,Fthe Channel via small boat under Prime
OL,16,FMinister Andy Burnham's reign is more
OL,17,Fthan 2,000.
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/11
