OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785772101
OL,3,CReform UK would use Navy to stop small
OL,4,Cboats in the Channel
OL,6,FThe latest figures also show that more
OL,7,Fthan 2,000 people have crossed the
OL,8,FEnglish Channel in small boats since
OL,9,FAndy Burnham became prime minister,
OL,10,Feven though the number of overall
OL,11,Farrivals for 2026 so far has dropped
OL,12,Fsince last year.
OL,14,FSpeaking to ITV News in September
OL,15,F2025, Farage said he was willing to
OL,16,Fuse military force against small
OL,17,Fboats, claiming the forces could drive
OL,18,Fthem back into France.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/11
